---
import Container from "../Container.astro";
---

<section class="sambutan-section" id="sambutan">
  <Container>
    <div class="sambutan-grid">
      <!-- Foto Kepala Sekolah dengan Red Card di Belakang -->
      <div class="principal-visual">
        <div class="photo-frame-wrapper">
          <!-- Dashed Halo Arc behind head -->
          <div class="dashed-halo-arc" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="360" height="360" viewBox="0 0 360 360" fill="none">
              <circle cx="180" cy="180" r="176" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="10 10" />
            </svg>
          </div>

          <!-- Red Shape with Large Rounded Corners & Watermark Rings -->
          <div class="red-bg-card" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="card-ring ring-left-1"></div>
            <div class="card-ring ring-left-2"></div>
            <div class="card-ring ring-right-1"></div>
            <div class="card-ring ring-right-2"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- Foto Kepala Sekolah -->
          <img
            src="/images/kepalaSekolah.png"
            alt="Kepala SMK Telkom Purwokerto - Aris Puji Santoso, S.Kom., M.M"
            class="principal-photo-img"
            width="530"
            height="796"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sambutan Copy -->
      <div class="sambutan-content">
        <div class="section-tagline">
          <span class="tagline-dash"></span>
          <span>SAMBUTAN</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="sambutan-title">
          <span class="text-red">Sambutan</span> Kepala Sekolah
        </h2>

        <p class="sambutan-desc">
          Selamat datang di portal resmi SMK Telkom Purwokerto. Kami percaya pendidikan vokasi yang baik lahir dari kedekatan dengan dunia industri, sehingga setiap program keahlian dirancang bersama mitra kerja dan diuji langsung melalui praktik nyata.
        </p>

        <p class="sambutan-desc">
          Melalui portal ini, seluruh layanan sekolah kami satukan agar siswa, orang tua, dan mitra industri mendapatkan informasi yang sama dan selalu terbarui.
        </p>

        <div class="principal-signoff">
          <h3 class="principal-name">Aris Puji Santoso, S.Kom., M.M</h3>
          <p class="principal-role">Kepala SMK Telkom Purwokerto</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
  .sambutan-section {
    padding: 5rem 0 4rem 0;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .sambutan-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 520px 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: flex-end;
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .principal-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-end;
    position: relative;
    height: 580px;
  }

  .photo-frame-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 520px;
    height: 580px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .dashed-halo-arc {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .red-bg-card {
    position: absolute;
    width: 500px;
    height: 420px;
    background: linear-gradient(157deg, #ed1e28 0%, #dc2626 52%, #dc2626 67%);
    border-radius: 140px 90px 140px 90px;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 0;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 2;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .card-ring {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 28px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ring-left-1 {
    width: 220px;
    height: 220px;
    left: -90px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .ring-left-2 {
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    left: -160px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .ring-right-1 {
    width: 220px;
    height: 220px;
    right: -90px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .ring-right-2 {
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    right: -160px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .principal-photo-img {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 3;
    width: 440px;
    max-width: none;
    height: auto;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    bottom: 0;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16));
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .sambutan-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-tagline {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    font-family: var(--font-poppins);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ed1e28;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .tagline-dash {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 22px;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: #ed1e28;
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  .sambutan-title {
    font-family: var(--font-poppins);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #111827;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .text-red {
    color: #ed1e28;
  }

  .sambutan-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-jakarta);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .sambutan-desc:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .principal-signoff {
    border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .principal-name {
    font-family: var(--font-jakarta);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .principal-role {
    font-family: var(--font-jakarta);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .sambutan-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .principal-visual {
      align-items: center;
      height: auto;
    }

    .sambutan-title {
      font-size: 2.15rem;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .photo-frame-wrapper {
      max-width: 440px;
      height: 500px;
    }

    .dashed-halo-arc {
      width: 300px;
      height: 300px;
    }

    .dashed-halo-arc svg {
      width: 300px;
      height: 300px;
    }

    .red-bg-card {
      width: 420px;
      height: 360px;
      border-radius: 110px 70px 110px 70px;
    }

    .principal-photo-img {
      width: 365px;
      bottom: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .sambutan-section {
      padding: 3rem 0;
    }

    .sambutan-title {
      font-size: 1.85rem;
    }

    .photo-frame-wrapper {
      max-width: 320px;
      height: 390px;
    }

    .red-bg-card {
      width: 310px;
      height: 270px;
      border-radius: 80px 50px 80px 50px;
    }

    .principal-photo-img {
      width: 285px;
      bottom: 0;
    }

    .dashed-halo-arc {
      width: 240px;
      height: 240px;
    }

    .dashed-halo-arc svg {
      width: 240px;
      height: 240px;
    }
  }
</style>
